# CFB27-Mods workspace

Local root: **`Desktop\CFB27-Mods`** (git repo). **Not** the CFB27 Tracker.

## Structure

- **One folder = one mod** at repo root (e.g. `2007-throwback\`, `custom-unis\`)
- **Shared only at root:** `tools\`, `assets\`, `docs\`, `scripts\`, `_template\`
- Never put tracker app code here

## New mod

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\new-mod.ps1 -Name "mod-name"
```

## Rules

- Back up saves before experiments; never commit `.sav` files
- Mod-specific files stay inside that mod's folder
- Tracker changes belong in `CFB27TRACKER` only

## Paths

- Saves: `%USERPROFILE%\Documents\College Football 27\Saves\`
- This workspace: `%USERPROFILE%\Desktop\CFB27-Mods\`
